            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Aug_19_2025_05_02_49_PM.webp",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "21h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>After a year of making excuses and avoiding<br/>intimacy, something finally shifted. I didn't tell her I was taking anything - wanted to see if she'd notice on her own. A few weeks in, she looked at me differently. Then she asked what's gotten into me. Morning wood came back first. Then the confidence. Now we're laughing in bed again like we did in our 30s.</p>",
