            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "6h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I spent over a thousand dollars on blood tests, urologists, supplements that did nothing. My testosterone came back<br/>\"in the normal range\" but I still couldn't stay hard long enough to penetrate. I was ready to give up. Tried this as a last shot. Week 3, I woke up hard for the first time in months.<br/>Week 6, I'm not rushing to finish anymore. I actually trust my body again.</p>",
