            "post_text": "<p>The more I worried, the faster it went away. It<br/>became a loop I couldn't escape. I stopped<br/>initiating. Started making excuses. My girlfriend was frustrated - I could see it.<br/>This stuff didn't work overnight, but by week 4 I noticed I wasn't in my head anymore. I was actually present. That changed everything.</p>",
